note RFC8446 bounded TLS1.3 client: api.github.com, X25519, 1303, CV0403.
note Concatenate tls-crypto.om and tls-cert.om before this file. No platform I/O.
note tlsinput(n): NEW bytes in Tlsin[0..n); internal residual retained; Tlsinlen becomes0.
note tlswrite(n)->bool: atomic acceptance, n<=16384; false means retain plaintext.
note tlssent acknowledges the ENTIRE output queue, then pumps deferred work.
note Tlsstate:0 lifecycle idle0 handshake1 open2 closed3 error4;1 error;2 peer close_notify.
note Errors:1 API bounds,2 capacity,3 crypto,4 record overflow,5 unexpected record,
note 6 bad MAC,7 malformed,8 unsupported,9 transcript cap,10 certificate,11 CV,
note 12 Finished,13 sequence limit,14 peer alert,15 HRR unsupported,16 key boundary,
note 17 KeyUpdate unsupported,18 absent time. Fatal/reset discards and wipes all queues.
note Limits: handshake and transcript65536, ciphertext16640, record plaintext16384,
note receive residual65536, app262144, epoch2^32-1 records. No tickets used or early data.
global Tlsin uchar 65536
global Tlsout uchar 65536
global Tlsplain uchar 65536
global Tlsapp uchar 262144
global Tlsrand uchar 64
