global Tsseq ulong 2
note Tsctl:0 recvlen,1 handlen,2 transcriptlen,3 localclose requested,
note 4 localclose queued,5 peerclose,6 phase,7 msglen,8 labellen,9 validated epoch time.
note phase0 SH,1 EE,2 Certificate,3 CV,4 Finished,5 application,6 client Finished pending.
global Tsctl ulong 10
